<title>Mexico's cartel violence: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/mexico/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-mexico-2026-11-14T14:22:18.977Z</guid>
<pubDate>Sat, 14 Nov 2026 14:22:18 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Mexican army units are engaging in street shootouts while hunting cartel gangsters in Jalisco and other states, and a police helicopter opened fire on a cartel chase near the U.S. border, killing a 7-year-old girl. An ICE officer in Maine shot and killed an immigrant after expressing hatred of immigrants. Antonio Oseguera Cervantes, brother of Jalisco New Generation co-founder El Mencho, was sentenced to 22 years in a U.S. prison for a drug-trafficking plot, and other cartel relatives received similar long sentences. The conflict still reflects historic violence, with 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMivgFBVV95cUxOYjRIMVB2OWgzY2tqM1EzcUk1aEZPRW0wd3FqbGRJLXowNktDUUVGLXgyb01ZbUNCd1R0RGxtY1hVVHR0alFvTE9oN3VqcHBDTlE5bndHMThRSHFQRU9LU2JqS1h3ZDl3dFdqbG1kNlZlSGFxODM1QzZBRzNtdENTY29pZWlPQlRTaE5lSVZLV2JBTVRxNlpIMm05VGdGSEQ1ODN2UlJ6emRnVHlaZkdBektHYU14ejNFMnRjRmdR?oc=5&quot;&gt;France 24&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiiwFBVV95cUxPSDJMU3FZUEdVZEgyazB0MU9pbndQZDVHS0RBUG5sUE5lRk53SVVhM3lzREFodG9KS2oyZVcxWHZFdHU0UmVHWGxFM0tOS3pIUEU3S2laXzdRMjhPLWJKYzZLUjZCUDVQNG5YRHl1YUVMWkJjOUY2OGhuVlFrbk55UER6RGxjcjFSRGpN?oc=5&quot;&gt;The New York Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMifEFVX3lxTFBnNXBQSjlLRnFxblRNRW5xYjBwbi0ySE1tNlV6ZUhNU3VqdURTSUZwendMM1pDZmV1MUcxNWlQcDlJSTAzekZIeTJmU0R2cGxEWU03ODF0S29PUXE2bVZHeFZNWW9PYkp1ZnVZb19OY1VsWi03RmJYQlJDT3E?oc=5&quot;&gt;Channel 4 News | Substack&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;KESQ&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;ABC7 Bay Area&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipAFBVV95cUxPa1gySFdxUEpMVEVQOTBWb1BjMU93NTVUZ1NrZzc0TzBEeFhEYmxJejdseDAyenFXODRmNzBEZlZM